(3558852, 498993, 38032, '<td valign="top">The mixed warm and cold here are quite appealing. The symbols here and colors really beg for a second and third look. The cool fingertips hold a burning cigarette - the thick warm coat  appears to be borrowed from a lover covers a chilly sexy outfit that she wears with confidence.  We wonder whether the hair is a wig but we don''t care.  The room is warm in the background and we wonder whether she wants to go back - I think so. The story is enticing, vexing  and revealing: 9 and fave</td>', 'The mixed warm and cold here are quite appealing. The symbols here and colors really beg for a second and third look. The cool fingertips hold a burning cigarette - the thick warm coat  appears to be borrowed from a lover covers a chilly sexy outfit that she wears with confidence.  We wonder whether the hair is a wig but we don''t care.  The room is warm in the background and we wonder whether she wants to go back - I think so. The story is enticing, vexing  and revealing: 9 and fave', '2007-04-18 10:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3558877, 498972, 43774, '<td valign="top">Looks washed out/dull. Try adding some contrast and maybe even saturating the colours here. Maybe even a closer crop to get rid of that ugly coloured background. Sharpen the eyes more.</td>', 'Looks washed out/dull. Try adding some contrast and maybe even saturating the colours here. Maybe even a closer crop to get rid of that ugly coloured background. Sharpen the eyes more.', '2007-04-18 11:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
