(3559493, 499284, 62925, '<td valign="top">nice perspective on the challenge, i would of liked a larger DoF though. Took me a while to realise what it was, larger DoF would distuingish it more</td>', 'nice perspective on the challenge, i would of liked a larger DoF though. Took me a while to realise what it was, larger DoF would distuingish it more', '2007-04-18 13:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559494, 499234, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful hair! Very long... the only thing I don''t really like is that on the girl''s right (our left) there is that gold/orange streak. It''s so abrupt it looks a little unnatural. If you could maybe smooth that out, or remove it all together it might look a little better. This is a very nice portrait though - good shot!</td>', 'Beautiful hair! Very long... the only thing I don''t really like is that on the girl''s right (our left) there is that gold/orange streak. It''s so abrupt it looks a little unnatural. If you could maybe smooth that out, or remove it all together it might look a little better. This is a very nice portrait though - good shot!', '2007-04-18 13:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559495, 499351, 68035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract/portrait, you feel this should be in a gallery somewhere<br/> <br/>Lovely job</td>', 'Beautiful abstract/portrait, you feel this should be in a gallery somewhere Lovely job', '2007-04-18 13:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
