(3559507, 499367, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very good clarity and good contrast. The title is perfect. The best image I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Very good clarity and good contrast. The title is perfect. The best image I''ve seen so far.', '2007-04-18 13:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
