(3559517, 498971, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea - I might suggest moving the camera back a little further to get more of the person. It''s so close it''s almost confusing - the composition almost feels a little cluttered. But this is a very cool idea! :) I like it! Keep shooting!</td>', 'This is an interesting idea - I might suggest moving the camera back a little further to get more of the person. It''s so close it''s almost confusing - the composition almost feels a little cluttered. But this is a very cool idea! :) I like it! Keep shooting!', '2007-04-18 13:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
