(3559585, 497280, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat! It would have been nice if the window was clean, of course, but there are some things you just can''t do. :P I might also suggest trying to change the focus next time - the focus should probably be on the bee''s eyes instead of the rest of the body. But I''m just getting picky now! I like all the details you have captured - good shot!</td>', 'Neat! It would have been nice if the window was clean, of course, but there are some things you just can''t do. :P I might also suggest trying to change the focus next time - the focus should probably be on the bee''s eyes instead of the rest of the body. But I''m just getting picky now! I like all the details you have captured - good shot!', '2007-04-18 13:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
