(3559603, 497348, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, there something that''s bothering me about this photo, and I''m not sure what. I don''t think it''s the lighting - the lighting looks really cool Maybe it''s because the dark and shadowy areas are grainy. But anyways, this is an intersting shot - I like seeing their reflection in the mirror! Very cool.</td>', 'Well, there something that''s bothering me about this photo, and I''m not sure what. I don''t think it''s the lighting - the lighting looks really cool Maybe it''s because the dark and shadowy areas are grainy. But anyways, this is an intersting shot - I like seeing their reflection in the mirror! Very cool.', '2007-04-18 13:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559604, 499289, 56539, '<td valign="top">Needs better masking</td>', 'Needs better masking', '2007-04-18 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559605, 499002, 63269, '<td valign="top">A little bit grainy - but I love the reflections and the colors! Beautiful shot.</td>', 'A little bit grainy - but I love the reflections and the colors! Beautiful shot.', '2007-04-18 13:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559607, 499162, 62925, '<td valign="top">wow, i had to double take!</td>', 'wow, i had to double take!', '2007-04-18 13:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559609, 497178, 5728, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the top photo would have been enough, it is full of power and the bottom two photos only detract from it. The top photo alone would have ribboned for you.</td>', 'In my opinion the top photo would have been enough, it is full of power and the bottom two photos only detract from it. The top photo alone would have ribboned for you.', '2007-04-18 13:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
