(3559714, 498862, 63269, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!! Absolutely.... I am utterly speechless! This is so unusual. I have never seen someone do this kind of selective desaturating. Leaving just the hair colored, and the face desaturated. <br/>Very beautiful, EXTREMELY unique! My only comlpaint is that it''s a little grainy... but I love the blur on the hair, the high contrast, and the black background. This is way too cool. :)</td>', 'WOW!!!!! Absolutely.... I am utterly speechless! This is so unusual. I have never seen someone do this kind of selective desaturating. Leaving just the hair colored, and the face desaturated. Very beautiful, EXTREMELY unique! My only comlpaint is that it''s a little grainy... but I love the blur on the hair, the high contrast, and the black background. This is way too cool. :)', '2007-04-18 14:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559715, 497306, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of the most creative shots in the challenge!</td>', 'One of the most creative shots in the challenge!', '2007-04-18 14:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
