(3559724, 498141, 58452, '<td valign="top">I almost wish this could be a tryptich (sp) so I could see the poor guy looking all around at all the scissors.  Very unique concept, maybe even Scalvertesque, but some how more humorous and playful....  maybe Cindi-esque.  LOL.  Love the composition.  I believe it will top ten.  Congrats.</td>', 'I almost wish this could be a tryptich (sp) so I could see the poor guy looking all around at all the scissors.  Very unique concept, maybe even Scalvertesque, but some how more humorous and playful....  maybe Cindi-esque.  LOL.  Love the composition.  I believe it will top ten.  Congrats.', '2007-04-18 14:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559727, 498763, 58452, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That you LeRoy???  Brush that off indeed!  Certainly hairy but there''s something disturbing about this.......<br/>can''t put my finger on it.  Certainly unique!</td>', 'Wow.  That you LeRoy???  Brush that off indeed!  Certainly hairy but there''s something disturbing about this.......can''t put my finger on it.  Certainly unique!', '2007-04-18 14:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
