(3561408, 497577, 27514, '<td valign="top">ohh wow, this is so cute. I love it. I think the focus is good and the expression is priceless. The lighting is the only thing I take issue with. the noise level in her eyes is a problem, and even though I understand the reason for the backlighting I think you need some sort of light in her eyes too. overall thought I think positives outweigh the negitives. good job!</td>', 'ohh wow, this is so cute. I love it. I think the focus is good and the expression is priceless. The lighting is the only thing I take issue with. the noise level in her eyes is a problem, and even though I understand the reason for the backlighting I think you need some sort of light in her eyes too. overall thought I think positives outweigh the negitives. good job!', '2007-04-18 23:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
