(3561417, 499387, 27514, '<td valign="top">wow, there are ton of things working for this image. I love the cropping the look in the eyes the use of dof. I do think the focus is a tad off and the catch lights are a little low. noise is an issue and I think a slight contrast bump would help. your whites are muddy. I like what your doing here though I really think it''s a nice image</td>', 'wow, there are ton of things working for this image. I love the cropping the look in the eyes the use of dof. I do think the focus is a tad off and the catch lights are a little low. noise is an issue and I think a slight contrast bump would help. your whites are muddy. I like what your doing here though I really think it''s a nice image', '2007-04-18 23:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
