(3562392, 499323, 34059, '<td valign="top">I guess it took a lot of time to compose this one, but the result is not so good... I like very much the concept ot the flower/sun, but it would have been better on a clean sky, the sun cannot be beneath the clouds! Also the hairy island is a nice idea, it goes well with the other islands and I appreciate that you can see where it is hit by the sun rays, but its lower edge is too sharp, it looks like if it was scissor cut from another picture and pasted here. It doesn''t merge with the rest of the picture and I think that the overall result is poor. But don''t be discouraged, you have been very creative and I''m sure that if you exercise with this technique you can reach better results. Good luck!</td>', 'I guess it took a lot of time to compose this one, but the result is not so good... I like very much the concept ot the flower/sun, but it would have been better on a clean sky, the sun cannot be beneath the clouds! Also the hairy island is a nice idea, it goes well with the other islands and I appreciate that you can see where it is hit by the sun rays, but its lower edge is too sharp, it looks like if it was scissor cut from another picture and pasted here. It doesn''t merge with the rest of the picture and I think that the overall result is poor. But don''t be discouraged, you have been very creative and I''m sure that if you exercise with this technique you can reach better results. Good luck!', '2007-04-19 09:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
