(3563095, 496673, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a good concept and I hope you''ll consider taking it again but with a light on your subject from behind and a more diffuse light from 3/4 rather than directly in front.  As it is, the light from the front causes your subjects hair to be so bright it obscures her face.  Lighting from behind and 3/4 should reduce that. <br/> <br/>Again, I really do hope you shoot this again and play with the lighting a bit.  I think You''d have a really nice image.</td>', 'This is a good concept and I hope you''ll consider taking it again but with a light on your subject from behind and a more diffuse light from 3/4 rather than directly in front.  As it is, the light from the front causes your subjects hair to be so bright it obscures her face.  Lighting from behind and 3/4 should reduce that.  Again, I really do hope you shoot this again and play with the lighting a bit.  I think You''d have a really nice image.', '2007-04-19 14:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
