(3563553, 498509, 9690, '<td valign="top">How wild!  I don''t think I like the extreme softness on the face as compared to the hair.  Its very distracting.  The black border is confusing, too.</td>', 'How wild!  I don''t think I like the extreme softness on the face as compared to the hair.  Its very distracting.  The black border is confusing, too.', '2007-04-19 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
