(3563561, 497669, 9690, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.. Not so sure I like the composition.  You are naturally drawn to her face and right off the right side of the image due to her stare.</td>', 'Hmmmm.. Not so sure I like the composition.  You are naturally drawn to her face and right off the right side of the image due to her stare.', '2007-04-19 16:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563566, 497415, 41370, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t decide how I wanted to vote on this photo.  I think it is very original and technically very good.  I initially wanted to DNMC it (and I''m sure many purists have done so).  I generally am a purist. However, after reading the challenge description I have decided to give it a 10.</td>', 'I couldn''t decide how I wanted to vote on this photo.  I think it is very original and technically very good.  I initially wanted to DNMC it (and I''m sure many purists have done so).  I generally am a purist. However, after reading the challenge description I have decided to give it a 10.', '2007-04-19 16:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563572, 499129, 9690, '<td valign="top">So very funny.  I think this is great!  There are two things I dont care for:  the door knob at the bottom right, and the recreation of the image in the frame on the wall.  I think what would be neat there (since you have expert editing rules), is to use the same goat but in a traditional pose you''d see in an image on the walls of a typical family home.  But overall, great!  9</td>', 'So very funny.  I think this is great!  There are two things I dont care for:  the door knob at the bottom right, and the recreation of the image in the frame on the wall.  I think what would be neat there (since you have expert editing rules), is to use the same goat but in a traditional pose you''d see in an image on the walls of a typical family home.  But overall, great!  9', '2007-04-19 16:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563573, 498595, 9690, '<td valign="top">Funky, but not appealling from an abstract level.</td>', 'Funky, but not appealling from an abstract level.', '2007-04-19 16:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
