(3564989, 498819, 77250, '<td valign="top">This is a very good job on the editing side of things.  I love the moment that you have captured/created here.  Great job at presenting something that can''t really be presented.  My only suggestion (to make your work better) is that the scene does look slightly fake, mostly because of the model''s expressions.  Great job overall though.</td>', 'This is a very good job on the editing side of things.  I love the moment that you have captured/created here.  Great job at presenting something that can''t really be presented.  My only suggestion (to make your work better) is that the scene does look slightly fake, mostly because of the model''s expressions.  Great job overall though.', '2007-04-20 02:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3564990, 499053, 77250, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  Great color and presentation.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  Great color and presentation.', '2007-04-20 02:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3564992, 498865, 77250, '<td valign="top">This is a very intriguing photograph.  Slightly surreal but confrontational.</td>', 'This is a very intriguing photograph.  Slightly surreal but confrontational.', '2007-04-20 02:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565001, 497849, 23146, '<td valign="top">A little bit out of focus</td>', 'A little bit out of focus', '2007-04-20 02:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565005, 498997, 68504, '<td valign="top">Dying to know what this is - a coconut?  Nice red tones and kitty paws.</td>', 'Dying to know what this is - a coconut?  Nice red tones and kitty paws.', '2007-04-20 02:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565011, 499201, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Great shutter speed and lighting.  Well photographed.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Great shutter speed and lighting.  Well photographed.', '2007-04-20 02:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565012, 496406, 77250, '<td valign="top">Interesting hair photograph.  I like the difference in detail that you''ve captured between the body hair and the head hair.  Well photographed.</td>', 'Interesting hair photograph.  I like the difference in detail that you''ve captured between the body hair and the head hair.  Well photographed.', '2007-04-20 02:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565014, 498652, 68504, '<td valign="top">Totally. Ribbon.</td>', 'Totally. Ribbon.', '2007-04-20 02:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565028, 499076, 68504, '<td valign="top">Like the utter solemnity of this bad hair day, nicely offset by the bw singing? speaking? forth photo on the white square of wall.  Oddly moving and refreshingly different among other entries so far.</td>', 'Like the utter solemnity of this bad hair day, nicely offset by the bw singing? speaking? forth photo on the white square of wall.  Oddly moving and refreshingly different among other entries so far.', '2007-04-20 02:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565051, 498746, 68504, '<td valign="top">Tres comme circle de soleil.  J''aime les souliers de soleil aussi.  (I regret only the blown highlights on her crowning glory; otherwise an outstanding composition in every way).</td>', 'Tres comme circle de soleil.  J''aime les souliers de soleil aussi.  (I regret only the blown highlights on her crowning glory; otherwise an outstanding composition in every way).', '2007-04-20 03:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
