(3566425, 497348, 51793, '<td valign="top">because your picture in the mirror doesn''t match what you are doing standing up it looks a little funny, BUT... instead of making it that way (if you did) instead you should have flip flopped positions so that the mirros has the customer giving the hair dresser the make over. That would have been really cool looking.</td>', 'because your picture in the mirror doesn''t match what you are doing standing up it looks a little funny, BUT... instead of making it that way (if you did) instead you should have flip flopped positions so that the mirros has the customer giving the hair dresser the make over. That would have been really cool looking.', '2007-04-20 15:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
