(3567712, 499076, 53814, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful capture. I think removing the foreground chair (at least on the left) and straightening the background would have put the expert editing tools to good use, without abusing them. -7</td>', 'This is a wonderful capture. I think removing the foreground chair (at least on the left) and straightening the background would have put the expert editing tools to good use, without abusing them. -7', '2007-04-21 01:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
