(3567831, 496354, 6804, '<td valign="top">Great perspective on the challenge theme!  The title helps to pull this into the challenge which is risky if you are going for the ribbon.  I love the image!  I think your choice of color tone really helps to put the "down and out" mood into the shot.  The metro-scape along with the grungy drips and splashes give this a feeling of an old picture in a box from some old musty smelling antique book store. It''s busy and noisy and still has the feeling of being all alone.  This one is getting a 10 from me.  The voters tend to favor a more literal approach to the challenge theme so I hope to see this one score better with the voters than I think it will. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great perspective on the challenge theme!  The title helps to pull this into the challenge which is risky if you are going for the ribbon.  I love the image!  I think your choice of color tone really helps to put the "down and out" mood into the shot.  The metro-scape along with the grungy drips and splashes give this a feeling of an old picture in a box from some old musty smelling antique book store. It''s busy and noisy and still has the feeling of being all alone.  This one is getting a 10 from me.  The voters tend to favor a more literal approach to the challenge theme so I hope to see this one score better with the voters than I think it will. Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-04-21 02:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567833, 496981, 76430, '<td valign="top">vacant look</td>', 'vacant look', '2007-04-21 02:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
