(3568288, 497905, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very intresting colors and lighting ... I''m not sure I really like it, but it gives the photo a very interesting mood. I like the composition, and the expression on the person''s face.</td>', 'Very intresting colors and lighting ... I''m not sure I really like it, but it gives the photo a very interesting mood. I like the composition, and the expression on the person''s face.', '2007-04-21 11:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568290, 498989, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, it took me a minute to figure out what it was - the forlock of a horse, right? :) It''s focued well, but.... it''s not a very artistic subject, because it''s so confusing. It might be interesting to move the camera back and get some more of the ears perhaps. But it''s a cool idea! GOod try! :)</td>', 'Well, it took me a minute to figure out what it was - the forlock of a horse, right? :) It''s focued well, but.... it''s not a very artistic subject, because it''s so confusing. It might be interesting to move the camera back and get some more of the ears perhaps. But it''s a cool idea! GOod try! :)', '2007-04-21 11:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568293, 499086, 63269, '<td valign="top">How on earth did you get the eyes like this? That and the hair really make this photo stand out! I love how you made the composition off-center. Wonderful shot.</td>', 'How on earth did you get the eyes like this? That and the hair really make this photo stand out! I love how you made the composition off-center. Wonderful shot.', '2007-04-21 11:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568297, 497271, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool idea! I love the firey colors - the hair really does look like flames! THe only thing I don''t really like is how much darker the hair around the person''s head is, compared to the rest. It would have been nice if you could have faded it a little more smoothly... but cool idea. A unique, interesting shot.</td>', 'This is a really cool idea! I love the firey colors - the hair really does look like flames! THe only thing I don''t really like is how much darker the hair around the person''s head is, compared to the rest. It would have been nice if you could have faded it a little more smoothly... but cool idea. A unique, interesting shot.', '2007-04-21 11:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568318, 498916, 63006, '<td valign="top">the hair looks a bit oversharpened, and the skin a bit too softened.. even though it was expert editing, i think you should have stayed with a bit less of it. on the other hand, it''s a great idea for such a challenge, and a great capture. i do like how the tail end of the braid falls below the frame, but it is a bit jagged looking where you cut out the background. <br/>in the end, it was a nice try, and you still get a 6 from me :)</td>', 'the hair looks a bit oversharpened, and the skin a bit too softened.. even though it was expert editing, i think you should have stayed with a bit less of it. on the other hand, it''s a great idea for such a challenge, and a great capture. i do like how the tail end of the braid falls below the frame, but it is a bit jagged looking where you cut out the background. in the end, it was a nice try, and you still get a 6 from me :)', '2007-04-21 11:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568410, 497993, 63269, '<td valign="top">VERY interesting...  Neat job!</td>', 'VERY interesting...  Neat job!', '2007-04-21 12:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568411, 499340, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and colors.</td>', 'Nice lighting and colors.', '2007-04-21 12:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568414, 497686, 63269, '<td valign="top">I might suggest brightening this photo up a little... there is nothing ''white'' in it; the highlights are grey, which makes it feel a litle dismal. A VERY cool idea though - excellent try!</td>', 'I might suggest brightening this photo up a little... there is nothing ''white'' in it; the highlights are grey, which makes it feel a litle dismal. A VERY cool idea though - excellent try!', '2007-04-21 12:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568431, 497996, 63269, '<td valign="top">THis is pretty, but the background is a little confusing... A plainer, simpler one might have helped. I like this though - good job!</td>', 'THis is pretty, but the background is a little confusing... A plainer, simpler one might have helped. I like this though - good job!', '2007-04-21 12:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568434, 497335, 63269, '<td valign="top">Something that really might help this shot out is a different point of view. Next time, try moving your camera down to the eye level of the boy. Everything else is great here - Nice shot! :)</td>', 'Something that really might help this shot out is a different point of view. Next time, try moving your camera down to the eye level of the boy. Everything else is great here - Nice shot! :)', '2007-04-21 12:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568444, 498652, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very clever! I like this!My only copmlaint is that a few of the people look almost skewed and distorted, namely the two fellows in the back right, and the farthest guy to the back, more towards the left. Not sure why this is... but it''s only a minor detail! :) Very neat, creative idea!</td>', 'Very clever! I like this!My only copmlaint is that a few of the people look almost skewed and distorted, namely the two fellows in the back right, and the farthest guy to the back, more towards the left. Not sure why this is... but it''s only a minor detail! :) Very neat, creative idea!', '2007-04-21 12:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568452, 498881, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful idea - I absolutley LOVE the colors! However, it looks either like it''s way out of focus... or possibly it was a large picture that you had to crop very very tiny to get this. The quality isn''t very good here... the details have been lost. You can see that especially in the shadows, there are little splotches of off-colors. The only thing I can suggest is next time getting very close to the subject, and keep the ISO low so that you can capture all those beautiful detials! Good try though - this is an awesome idea!</td>', 'This is a beautiful idea - I absolutley LOVE the colors! However, it looks either like it''s way out of focus... or possibly it was a large picture that you had to crop very very tiny to get this. The quality isn''t very good here... the details have been lost. You can see that especially in the shadows, there are little splotches of off-colors. The only thing I can suggest is next time getting very close to the subject, and keep the ISO low so that you can capture all those beautiful detials! Good try though - this is an awesome idea!', '2007-04-21 12:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568455, 499091, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful! Is it just me though, or is it slightly out of focus? I''m not sure... I can''t quite pinpoint what''s making it look that way... but the colors and textures here are just lovely. Very nice!</td>', 'Very beautiful! Is it just me though, or is it slightly out of focus? I''m not sure... I can''t quite pinpoint what''s making it look that way... but the colors and textures here are just lovely. Very nice!', '2007-04-21 12:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568460, 498940, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the way the hair is splayed out in waves like that, and the expression on the person''s face is perfect! But, well, here''s my two cents. :) <br/>It looks kind of out of focus, first of all. If you can get the focus on, then that will majorly help! Secondly, the colors are too far off. It looks like you probably did this on purpose, and it creates an intersting effect, but it''s just a little bit too unnatural-looking, at least for me! ;) Also the lighting. Or maybe the contrast is just too high - but her face is very blown out and way too bright. I think this would be an awesome, beautiful shot if it weren''t for that! Good try though. :)</td>', 'I love the way the hair is splayed out in waves like that, and the expression on the person''s face is perfect! But, well, here''s my two cents. :) It looks kind of out of focus, first of all. If you can get the focus on, then that will majorly help! Secondly, the colors are too far off. It looks like you probably did this on purpose, and it creates an intersting effect, but it''s just a little bit too unnatural-looking, at least for me! ;) Also the lighting. Or maybe the contrast is just too high - but her face is very blown out and way too bright. I think this would be an awesome, beautiful shot if it weren''t for that! Good try though. :)', '2007-04-21 12:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568464, 497103, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! It would probably help if the photo was a tiny bit bigger - I almost always go right to the limit with the size on my photos, since the voters don''t seem to really like the smaller shots. Also the color looks a little off - her hair is all black, with a little bit of almost green. (which I''m guessing is not it''s real color! :) ) So... I wonder if there''s anyway to fix that? It would be cool to experiment around in photoshop and give it a try. But a neat shot! Hope your camera didn''t get too wet! :)</td>', 'Nice capture! It would probably help if the photo was a tiny bit bigger - I almost always go right to the limit with the size on my photos, since the voters don''t seem to really like the smaller shots. Also the color looks a little off - her hair is all black, with a little bit of almost green. (which I''m guessing is not it''s real color! :) ) So... I wonder if there''s anyway to fix that? It would be cool to experiment around in photoshop and give it a try. But a neat shot! Hope your camera didn''t get too wet! :)', '2007-04-21 12:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3568466, 499387, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very cute! I like the focus and your composition!</td>', 'Very cute! I like the focus and your composition!', '2007-04-21 12:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
