(3569985, 497305, 53964, '<td valign="top">This expression is priceless, and then topped off with the wild mane... hilarious!<br/> <br/>I''d have cropped it tighter to remove the arm and as much of the furniture as possible on the right, and given more contrast. But it''s a very cute capture and fits the challenge :)</td>', 'This expression is priceless, and then topped off with the wild mane... hilarious! I''d have cropped it tighter to remove the arm and as much of the furniture as possible on the right, and given more contrast. But it''s a very cute capture and fits the challenge :)', '2007-04-22 04:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3569988, 499238, 53964, '<td valign="top">Technically great, but for some reason it doesn''t really appeal to me, and I can''t figure out quite why...?</td>', 'Technically great, but for some reason it doesn''t really appeal to me, and I can''t figure out quite why...?', '2007-04-22 04:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
