(3569997, 497675, 60195, '<td valign="top">Definitely my pick for the blue. Nice overall feel, great lighting, and awesome colors! Wonderful post turned this good shot into a great one - well done.  That eye color absolutely made this shot. Stunning. Fav.</td>', 'Definitely my pick for the blue. Nice overall feel, great lighting, and awesome colors! Wonderful post turned this good shot into a great one - well done.  That eye color absolutely made this shot. Stunning. Fav.', '2007-04-22 04:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
