(3572701, 498973, 22689, '<td valign="top">Something like "Étude inachevée du buste d''une femme" or "Étude d''un buste de femme , inachevé" would have sound better , more french in my opinion.<br/>But I prefer to only vote the photos and yours is excellent , my favorite in this challenge.<br/>I like the fact that you have used the possibilities of expert editing.<br/>The result is very tasteful and delicate.</td>', 'Something like "Étude inachevée du buste d''une femme" or "Étude d''un buste de femme , inachevé" would have sound better , more french in my opinion.But I prefer to only vote the photos and yours is excellent , my favorite in this challenge.I like the fact that you have used the possibilities of expert editing.The result is very tasteful and delicate.', '2007-04-23 08:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572703, 498973, 57060, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful shot, great idea for PP; fantastic lighting. <br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Wow, beautiful shot, great idea for PP; fantastic lighting.  Jack', '2007-04-23 08:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3572741, 498973, 67258, '<td valign="top">I really, really, really like the ''photo'' part of this, but I also really dislike the lower ''sketch'' part of the image; I would much prefer a nude photograph, and I feel that you would have carried it off in a tasteful manner.  I am only going to give a 6, largely because I feel the transition from sketch to photo doesn''t work particularly well here.  Nonetheless, it was an interesting technique to try out, and may be worth exploring further; I do admire the fact that you have tried something new and bold.</td>', 'I really, really, really like the ''photo'' part of this, but I also really dislike the lower ''sketch'' part of the image; I would much prefer a nude photograph, and I feel that you would have carried it off in a tasteful manner.  I am only going to give a 6, largely because I feel the transition from sketch to photo doesn''t work particularly well here.  Nonetheless, it was an interesting technique to try out, and may be worth exploring further; I do admire the fact that you have tried something new and bold.', '2007-04-23 08:38:45.000000', NULL, 1);
