(3573541, 497415, 72840, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, but there is no hair in this image.</td>', 'Creative idea, but there is no hair in this image.', '2007-04-23 13:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573543, 499214, 72838, '<td valign="top">I love this image. Creative idea and good photo. Nice job!</td>', 'I love this image. Creative idea and good photo. Nice job!', '2007-04-23 13:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573544, 498117, 72840, '<td valign="top">I like all of the bright colors in this image. They really pop out at you. Very nice</td>', 'I like all of the bright colors in this image. They really pop out at you. Very nice', '2007-04-23 13:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573548, 498746, 72840, '<td valign="top">I love this image. Very creative...amazing composition and colors.  The yellow hair definately grabs my attention. It is a very interesting image. Great job.</td>', 'I love this image. Very creative...amazing composition and colors.  The yellow hair definately grabs my attention. It is a very interesting image. Great job.', '2007-04-23 13:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573550, 498881, 72840, '<td valign="top">This image i way to close up...it looks very blurry.</td>', 'This image i way to close up...it looks very blurry.', '2007-04-23 13:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573552, 498956, 72838, '<td valign="top">This image is AMAZING. I love the lighting and the BOY is so cute. Great job!</td>', 'This image is AMAZING. I love the lighting and the BOY is so cute. Great job!', '2007-04-23 13:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573553, 499287, 74015, '<td valign="top">The image is underexposed and very noisy, which is too bad because the expression of the girl is great: it is natural and mysterious at the same time.  It makes you wonder what the heck she was thinking/looking at to have that "Mona Lisa" smile.  Maybe a bit of flash or playing with exp. comp. would have helped bring the exposure up.</td>', 'The image is underexposed and very noisy, which is too bad because the expression of the girl is great: it is natural and mysterious at the same time.  It makes you wonder what the heck she was thinking/looking at to have that "Mona Lisa" smile.  Maybe a bit of flash or playing with exp. comp. would have helped bring the exposure up.', '2007-04-23 13:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573555, 497675, 72840, '<td valign="top">This image is very nice. I think it would have been better if the hair was a little bit more in the image. My attention is drawn more to the eye than the hair. Nice shot though.</td>', 'This image is very nice. I think it would have been better if the hair was a little bit more in the image. My attention is drawn more to the eye than the hair. Nice shot though.', '2007-04-23 13:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573561, 499214, 72840, '<td valign="top">This image is very interesting. It draws attention which is good.  I like the blue color and the texture created by the flowing hair. Nice Job!</td>', 'This image is very interesting. It draws attention which is good.  I like the blue color and the texture created by the flowing hair. Nice Job!', '2007-04-23 13:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573583, 497238, 74015, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love the soft focus around the face and the exposure is just right.  An 8.</td>', 'Wow!  I love the soft focus around the face and the exposure is just right.  An 8.', '2007-04-23 13:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573599, 497485, 74015, '<td valign="top">I really like what you did to the eyes.  This is what sets this shot apart from the other shots of people with hair partially covering their faces.  I''d be curious to know how you did that...</td>', 'I really like what you did to the eyes.  This is what sets this shot apart from the other shots of people with hair partially covering their faces.  I''d be curious to know how you did that...', '2007-04-23 13:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573613, 496457, 74015, '<td valign="top">Effective composition, with a nice catch light in the eye.  Nice job!</td>', 'Effective composition, with a nice catch light in the eye.  Nice job!', '2007-04-23 13:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573624, 499298, 74015, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t seem to mind...</td>', 'She doesn''t seem to mind...', '2007-04-23 13:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573640, 496497, 30214, '<td valign="top">amazing hair, amazing face, and amazing body. Excellent pose and lighting. What is "less excellent" is the background - kind of random with the sign partially blocked by the model, a little bit overprocessed skin (or maybe it is an artifact of the small size?) and, yes, small size of the photo. Still, great shot!</td>', 'amazing hair, amazing face, and amazing body. Excellent pose and lighting. What is "less excellent" is the background - kind of random with the sign partially blocked by the model, a little bit overprocessed skin (or maybe it is an artifact of the small size?) and, yes, small size of the photo. Still, great shot!', '2007-04-23 13:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573645, 499351, 30214, '<td valign="top">great composition</td>', 'great composition', '2007-04-23 13:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573649, 499064, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice abstract</td>', 'nice abstract', '2007-04-23 13:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573655, 499111, 30214, '<td valign="top">not a very appealing photo (how can it be with this subject matter? :)), but a nice idea.</td>', 'not a very appealing photo (how can it be with this subject matter? :)), but a nice idea.', '2007-04-23 13:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573660, 499025, 30214, '<td valign="top">very good portrait. Love the soft and warm lighting</td>', 'very good portrait. Love the soft and warm lighting', '2007-04-23 13:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573667, 499323, 30214, '<td valign="top">creative idea, but you need a better merging technique. The bottom edge of the hair is just straight and looks very fake.</td>', 'creative idea, but you need a better merging technique. The bottom edge of the hair is just straight and looks very fake.', '2007-04-23 13:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573669, 497849, 30214, '<td valign="top">out of focus... i wonder how many comments like this you got? :)</td>', 'out of focus... i wonder how many comments like this you got? :)', '2007-04-23 13:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573674, 497305, 30214, '<td valign="top">that expression is priceless. The technicals are not so good:a little soft, the colors are washed out, background is kind of random</td>', 'that expression is priceless. The technicals are not so good:a little soft, the colors are washed out, background is kind of random', '2007-04-23 14:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573691, 498916, 30214, '<td valign="top">cool idea. Nice composition and lighting. There are some processing flaws, especially the way hair goes over the border, it is obvious that hair in fact did not end there but was "cut off"  in photoshop. And the hair at the foreground apparently was slightly out of focus and oversharpened later, which also shows. Should''ve used smaller aperture to increase depth of focus.</td>', 'cool idea. Nice composition and lighting. There are some processing flaws, especially the way hair goes over the border, it is obvious that hair in fact did not end there but was "cut off"  in photoshop. And the hair at the foreground apparently was slightly out of focus and oversharpened later, which also shows. Should''ve used smaller aperture to increase depth of focus.', '2007-04-23 14:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573693, 499340, 30214, '<td valign="top">cool hair, and cool photo. The background is a bit dull, some OOF stuff (a band, or even a wall with some rock posters) would help a lot.</td>', 'cool hair, and cool photo. The background is a bit dull, some OOF stuff (a band, or even a wall with some rock posters) would help a lot.', '2007-04-23 14:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573695, 498940, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice composition but colors and exposure are a bit off.</td>', 'nice composition but colors and exposure are a bit off.', '2007-04-23 14:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573699, 498272, 30214, '<td valign="top">interesting photo, just don''t care for  this random selective desaturation trick</td>', 'interesting photo, just don''t care for  this random selective desaturation trick', '2007-04-23 14:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573701, 498865, 30214, '<td valign="top">interesting composition, just the head is way oversharpened</td>', 'interesting composition, just the head is way oversharpened', '2007-04-23 14:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3573704, 496354, 30214, '<td valign="top">interesting photo. just a bit struggling to make a connection with the hair challenge.</td>', 'interesting photo. just a bit struggling to make a connection with the hair challenge.', '2007-04-23 14:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
