(3574017, 498118, 61961, '<td valign="top">I greatly admire this photo.  A ten from me.  Nice composition.  Excellent color palette.  I love the textures, especially the leather.  Fits the theme.  Compliments to your model, too!</td>', 'I greatly admire this photo.  A ten from me.  Nice composition.  Excellent color palette.  I love the textures, especially the leather.  Fits the theme.  Compliments to your model, too!', '2007-04-23 15:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3574028, 497485, 61961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, nicely lit.  Definitely fits the theme.  The b&amp;w works here.  Good lighting and clarity where it counts.  I love the "added bonus" of the touches of facial hair.  Not sure if I like the PP on the eye, though it *is* striking.  Anyhow a 10 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, nicely lit.  Definitely fits the theme.  The b&w works here.  Good lighting and clarity where it counts.  I love the "added bonus" of the touches of facial hair.  Not sure if I like the PP on the eye, though it *is* striking.  Anyhow a 10 from me.', '2007-04-23 15:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3574045, 497314, 61961, '<td valign="top">Is this really a self-portrait?  If so, you are a fine young photographer!  The adult hairdo and confident pose contrast in an intriguing way with the t-shirt and your evident youth.  Good lighting, focus could maybe be a tad sharper but the softness does not hurt the image in my opinion.  Reminds me of the work of Sally Mann.  A high vote from me.</td>', 'Is this really a self-portrait?  If so, you are a fine young photographer!  The adult hairdo and confident pose contrast in an intriguing way with the t-shirt and your evident youth.  Good lighting, focus could maybe be a tad sharper but the softness does not hurt the image in my opinion.  Reminds me of the work of Sally Mann.  A high vote from me.', '2007-04-23 15:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3574061, 498916, 61961, '<td valign="top">Fits the theme well -- hair is clearly the focus.  Cleverly realized and beautifully photographed.  My only complaint is that the hair that spills into the white frame seems choppy -- I''d rather see the idea abandoned that see it poorly done.</td>', 'Fits the theme well -- hair is clearly the focus.  Cleverly realized and beautifully photographed.  My only complaint is that the hair that spills into the white frame seems choppy -- I''d rather see the idea abandoned that see it poorly done.', '2007-04-23 15:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
