(3576083, 496673, 74371, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t think much of this shot...then I looked at it. I like that although the hair is pretty much in focus... so is the model''s face. Your entry most definitely fits the challenge, and, what I like more is that although the hair would have been great all by itself... the face is actually framed by the hair making the complete picture. Good job!<br/>                             (7)</td>', 'At first I didn''t think much of this shot...then I looked at it. I like that although the hair is pretty much in focus... so is the model''s face. Your entry most definitely fits the challenge, and, what I like more is that although the hair would have been great all by itself... the face is actually framed by the hair making the complete picture. Good job!                             (7)', '2007-04-24 07:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576086, 497238, 74371, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Excellent job of focusing, alignment, and overall appeal. Your choice of subject matter is absolutely marvelous. I love the look that you captured on this wonderful beast! Outstanding job!!<br/>                             (9)</td>', 'I love this shot. Excellent job of focusing, alignment, and overall appeal. Your choice of subject matter is absolutely marvelous. I love the look that you captured on this wonderful beast! Outstanding job!!                             (9)', '2007-04-24 07:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576089, 499238, 74371, '<td valign="top">Well focused and centered. I like the way the picture separates the water drops, but I think I might have gone for the opposite effect if I had come up with this inspired idea. Instead of using a more "stop action" shutter speed, I think I might have tried slowing it down to 1/30 or 1/15 to get a cascading effect rather than simply a wet head.<br/> <br/>A pleasing shot nevertheless.</td>', 'Well focused and centered. I like the way the picture separates the water drops, but I think I might have gone for the opposite effect if I had come up with this inspired idea. Instead of using a more "stop action" shutter speed, I think I might have tried slowing it down to 1/30 or 1/15 to get a cascading effect rather than simply a wet head. A pleasing shot nevertheless.', '2007-04-24 07:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576090, 499351, 74371, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2007-04-24 07:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576093, 498349, 74371, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! I like the effect of where she seems to be dragging the whole lake up when she pulls up her head. Good job!</td>', 'Excellent shot! I like the effect of where she seems to be dragging the whole lake up when she pulls up her head. Good job!', '2007-04-24 07:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576095, 496999, 74371, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2007-04-24 07:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576096, 499070, 74371, '<td valign="top">An excellent use of lighting and in using the make-up and the glitter to further exploit the light.<br/> <br/>The overall picture is glamorous and I really like it, but for some reason the overall effect makes me feel sad for the young lady. <br/> <br/>Great job!!               (8)</td>', 'An excellent use of lighting and in using the make-up and the glitter to further exploit the light. The overall picture is glamorous and I really like it, but for some reason the overall effect makes me feel sad for the young lady.  Great job!!               (8)', '2007-04-24 07:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576108, 499323, 74371, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Well thought out. I would have rated it higher except for the fact that, in my opinion, where the hair and the water meet is too precise. If you had roughened it up a bit...cannot think of the correct word for the process (age is horrible on the intelligent mind) but this way just seems too ''clean'' of a cut. <br/> <br/>Otherwise... nicely thought out shot. The flower representing the sun was a nice touch!</td>', 'Interesting shot. Well thought out. I would have rated it higher except for the fact that, in my opinion, where the hair and the water meet is too precise. If you had roughened it up a bit...cannot think of the correct word for the process (age is horrible on the intelligent mind) but this way just seems too ''clean'' of a cut.  Otherwise... nicely thought out shot. The flower representing the sun was a nice touch!', '2007-04-24 07:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576109, 499002, 74371, '<td valign="top">She is a definite cutie!</td>', 'She is a definite cutie!', '2007-04-24 07:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
