(3579213, 498698, 74371, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure what this is. That is the only reason I scored it low. It appears to be well focused, and seems to adhere to the challenge guidelines but not knowing what I am looking at (or any clue at all) is a major distraction for me. Could it be a barrette? A piece of glass?<br/> <br/>I think maybe if you were to back the lens down a little in order to show us a tad bit more of the subject that it would be a better scoring...at least by me...photograph. Maybe a different angle. Depth of field?  I don''t know. Like I said... it appears to be a nice photo but since I think i SHOULD know what it is, but don''t, I couldn''t score it higher than a 4. Sorry!</td>', 'Not entirely sure what this is. That is the only reason I scored it low. It appears to be well focused, and seems to adhere to the challenge guidelines but not knowing what I am looking at (or any clue at all) is a major distraction for me. Could it be a barrette? A piece of glass? I think maybe if you were to back the lens down a little in order to show us a tad bit more of the subject that it would be a better scoring...at least by me...photograph. Maybe a different angle. Depth of field?  I don''t know. Like I said... it appears to be a nice photo but since I think i SHOULD know what it is, but don''t, I couldn''t score it higher than a 4. Sorry!', '2007-04-25 00:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
