(3579904, 498891, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh sheesh. Very underrated in my opinion.  Portraits come in different styles, and this one is unusual but none the less wonderful.  Looking at your editing steps you should be VERY PROUD of this amazing piece of art... you took so many elements and combined them in ways that enhanced them all, instead of one detracting from the other (overpowering background, or so forth).  And I really love that you did the heart on your leg.. it sounds like it was an accident that it became part of this image? but I think it worked better than probably a heart on paper might.  <br/> <br/>In other words.... amaaazing. :-D</td>', 'Oh sheesh. Very underrated in my opinion.  Portraits come in different styles, and this one is unusual but none the less wonderful.  Looking at your editing steps you should be VERY PROUD of this amazing piece of art... you took so many elements and combined them in ways that enhanced them all, instead of one detracting from the other (overpowering background, or so forth).  And I really love that you did the heart on your leg.. it sounds like it was an accident that it became part of this image? but I think it worked better than probably a heart on paper might.   In other words.... amaaazing. :-D', '2007-04-25 02:37:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3579912, 498990, 53316, '<td valign="top">Ahhh! So underrated. I would have bet anything this would have been near the top.</td>', 'Ahhh! So underrated. I would have bet anything this would have been near the top.', '2007-04-25 02:39:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3579917, 498973, 40679, '<td valign="top">:D</td>', ':D', '2007-04-25 02:40:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3579926, 499015, 53316, '<td valign="top">Haven''t seen 300 but just looked up <a href="//nudo.nu/wp-content/300.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this image</a>... what is so great about your photo is that it works wonderfully if you have seen the movie or if you haven''t.  I wish this had scored higher.. I definitely think it deserved to.</td>', 'Haven''t seen 300 but just looked up this image... what is so great about your photo is that it works wonderfully if you have seen the movie or if you haven''t.  I wish this had scored higher.. I definitely think it deserved to.', '2007-04-25 02:41:24.000000', NULL, 0),
