(3580783, 499015, 9964, '<td valign="top">I''m happy to see a fellow member that can use Photoshop to expand their photography into new visual realms. It is sad to see the words "Digital Art" thrown around on this site when it''s used in the "it''s not photography debate". I laughed to myself quietly many years ago "1999" at a local photography club meeting when the majority of members voted not to allow any work to be considered produced from digital cameras. So carry on my friend and embrace this ever - changing world of photography with passion and most of all "laughter".</td>', 'I''m happy to see a fellow member that can use Photoshop to expand their photography into new visual realms. It is sad to see the words "Digital Art" thrown around on this site when it''s used in the "it''s not photography debate". I laughed to myself quietly many years ago "1999" at a local photography club meeting when the majority of members voted not to allow any work to be considered produced from digital cameras. So carry on my friend and embrace this ever - changing world of photography with passion and most of all "laughter".', '2007-04-25 09:48:40.000000', NULL, 0),
