(3581465, 498634, 75651, '<td valign="top">Thank you guys and gals for all of your support on this photo.  Your comments lifted my spirits pretty high and they were definitely greatly appreciated!<br/> <br/>I don''t mind that this photo placed where it did.  It was meant to be rather controversial to begin with due to the Expert editing, but the fact that you are suppose to stay true to the "integrity" of the photo.  I like to take different spins on that.  Most people think that you add to photos to enhance them, instead of enhancing my photo by adding, I simple subtracted the surroundings of the photos in order to get a surreal, or as most of you thought, a "publication or illustration" type photo.  Still felt I was true to photo quality, but I guess you can only add images or filters in order for a picture to stay true.<br/> <br/>I had fun doing it though and it''s permanentely part of my portfolio now.<br/> <br/>Thank you again for all of your support, I love hearing from you all. Hopefully, there will be more creative original ideas that come out to add some more controversy and discussion. (And maybe a ribbon in the distant, distant future!)<br/> <br/>okay, enough now, my head is swelling! (no sexual undertone intended)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you guys and gals for all of your support on this photo.  Your comments lifted my spirits pretty high and they were definitely greatly appreciated! I don''t mind that this photo placed where it did.  It was meant to be rather controversial to begin with due to the Expert editing, but the fact that you are suppose to stay true to the "integrity" of the photo.  I like to take different spins on that.  Most people think that you add to photos to enhance them, instead of enhancing my photo by adding, I simple subtracted the surroundings of the photos in order to get a surreal, or as most of you thought, a "publication or illustration" type photo.  Still felt I was true to photo quality, but I guess you can only add images or filters in order for a picture to stay true. I had fun doing it though and it''s permanentely part of my portfolio now. Thank you again for all of your support, I love hearing from you all. Hopefully, there will be more creative original ideas that come out to add some more controversy and discussion. (And maybe a ribbon in the distant, distant future!) okay, enough now, my head is swelling! (no sexual undertone intended) ', '2007-04-25 12:45:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3581481, 498973, 66348, '<td valign="top">Just an incredible shot, what an idea!! The lighting is beyond incredible and the editing is just perfect. Congrats on an amazing entry.</td>', 'Just an incredible shot, what an idea!! The lighting is beyond incredible and the editing is just perfect. Congrats on an amazing entry.', '2007-04-25 12:47:58.000000', NULL, 0),
