(3586372, 498888, 53964, '<td valign="top">I love this one and though it''s not a colour I would have thought of, it works wonderfully :)<br/> <br/>I''ve found that "surface blur" at low settings can give me better results with some kinds of noise than the special noiseware products.<br/>It smooths out flat surfaces like the background without affecting detailed parts.  It might work here? :)</td>', 'I love this one and though it''s not a colour I would have thought of, it works wonderfully :) I''ve found that "surface blur" at low settings can give me better results with some kinds of noise than the special noiseware products.It smooths out flat surfaces like the background without affecting detailed parts.  It might work here? :)', '2007-04-26 20:34:16.000000', NULL, 0),
