(3587156, 498973, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TooCool:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m sorry, I don''t get it.  I do not understand how this fits into the category of photography.  I don''t understand why this won a blue ribbon in a photography contest.  This is why I don''t like the expert editing rule set.  I didn''t vote in this challenge but if I did, you would have recieved another one.  Call me old school but please don''t hate me because I am.  I can''t help it...<br/>TC </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>your opinion is as valuable as the next, i like the pic but i do understand where you''re coming from</td>', 'Originally posted by TooCool: I''m sorry, I don''t get it.  I do not understand how this fits into the category of photography.  I don''t understand why this won a blue ribbon in a photography contest.  This is why I don''t like the expert editing rule set.  I didn''t vote in this challenge but if I did, you would have recieved another one.  Call me old school but please don''t hate me because I am.  I can''t help it...TC   your opinion is as valuable as the next, i like the pic but i do understand where you''re coming from', '2007-04-27 00:53:12.000000', NULL, 0),
