(3588327, 499243, 73250, '<td valign="top">I liked this image...the background suits it. I completely understood the pick in hair (very retro!). And I liked that you could see the individaul hairs. Although, there is the one spot near the pick that is blurred and not as crisp as the rest. I also wasn''t keen on your title.</td>', 'I liked this image...the background suits it. I completely understood the pick in hair (very retro!). And I liked that you could see the individaul hairs. Although, there is the one spot near the pick that is blurred and not as crisp as the rest. I also wasn''t keen on your title.', '2007-04-27 14:03:34.000000', NULL, 0),
