(3588428, 498796, 63269, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out why this didn''t get AT LEAST in the top ten! I was thinking it would get a ribbon. I thought that the voters loved this style of photo. Okay, it still got a lovely score, but seriously! Why not a ribbon? It was robbed. :P Lovely shot!</td>', 'I can''t figure out why this didn''t get AT LEAST in the top ten! I was thinking it would get a ribbon. I thought that the voters loved this style of photo. Okay, it still got a lovely score, but seriously! Why not a ribbon? It was robbed. :P Lovely shot!', '2007-04-27 14:41:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3588456, 496497, 51538, '<td valign="top">She''s a lovely model indeed and elegantly posed to reveal her beautiful hair.  Pity about the sign, but we all learn.  Anyway, I hope you''re not put off by the negative comments and will contribute some more photos in challenges.  Welcome to DPC.  My Grandad was Danish and I have a love of that country too.</td>', 'She''s a lovely model indeed and elegantly posed to reveal her beautiful hair.  Pity about the sign, but we all learn.  Anyway, I hope you''re not put off by the negative comments and will contribute some more photos in challenges.  Welcome to DPC.  My Grandad was Danish and I have a love of that country too.', '2007-04-27 14:51:37.000000', NULL, 0),
